@startuml 01_use_cases_operator
left to right direction
actor "Approved operator" as Operator
actor "Workspace owner/admin" as Admin
actor "Workspace viewer" as Viewer
Admin --|> Operator
Viewer --|> Operator
rectangle "FleetLuma cloud dashboard (v0.1.0 target)" {
 usecase "Sign in (Supabase Auth)" as Login
 usecase "View workspace fleet" as Fleet
 usecase "Inspect host metrics/history/processes" as Inspect
 usecase "See latest report age" as Age
 usecase "Add device by pairing code" as Pair
 usecase "Review pairing metadata" as Review
 usecase "Approve/deny device" as Decide
 usecase "Rename/revoke device" as Manage
 usecase "Review device audit" as Audit
 usecase "Inspect HTTP service health (future FL-19)" as Service
}
Operator --> Login
Operator --> Fleet
Operator --> Inspect
Operator --> Service
Admin --> Pair
Admin --> Decide
Admin --> Manage
Admin --> Audit
Pair ..> Review : <<include>>
Decide ..> Review : <<include>>
Fleet ..> Age : <<include>>
Inspect ..> Age : <<include>>
note right of Login
 Sign-in alone never grants fleet access.
 API checks approved JWT and workspace membership.
end note
@enduml
